[I] A nice replacement for the dark default XMMS skin

[T] Winamp X is a skin for the XMMS audio player, offering a nice
[T] replacement for the dark default XMMS skin. It is installed into the
[T] XMMS skins directory and selected in the player's skin browser.

[U] http://www.xmms.org/skins.php

[A] Deelight <deelight@flashmail.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 1.01

[D] c9ca95d36ee760c53b3b9bd7ef81cabf91fd15cb4594623664e791cd Winamp_X_XMMS_1.01.tar.gz http://www.xmms.org/files/Skins/

runmake=0
hook_add postmake 5 "cd ..; cp -rfv Winamp_X_XMMS_* $root$datadir/xmms/Skins/"
